  "talents_description": {
    "modifier_undying_1_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Soul Rip.</font></b> \n\n Every Second, the Hero deals Physical Damage to all enemies within a 400 radius around him: 12%/24%/36% from Strength",
    "modifier_undying_1_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Soul Rip.</font></b> \n\n Every Second, the Hero deals Physical Damage to all enemies within a 400 radius around him: <b><font color='#eabe10'>12%</font></b>/24%/36% from Strength",
    "modifier_undying_1_2": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Soul Rip.</font></b> \n\n Every Second, the Hero deals Physical Damage to all enemies within a 400 radius around him: 12%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>24%</font></b>/36% from Strength",
    "modifier_undying_1_3": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Soul Rip.</font></b> \n\n Every Second, the Hero deals Physical Damage to all enemies within a 400 radius around him: 12%/24%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>36%</font></b> from Strength",
    "modifier_undying_2_0": "Decay pulls all affected enemies towards the Hero by a Distance: 60/120",
    "modifier_undying_2_1": "Decay pulls all affected enemies towards the Hero by a Distance: <b><font color='#eabe10'>60</font></b>/120",
    "modifier_undying_2_2": "Decay pulls all affected enemies towards the Hero by a Distance: 60/<b><font color='#eabe10'>120</font></b>",
    "modifier_undying_3_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Tombstone. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: Hypnodancer \n\n The hero gains speed and casts Decay around himself every 3 seconds. You cannot attack and also gain unlimited vision. \n\n Duration: 3 sec. \n Movement Speed: 20% Radius: 600 \n Cooldown: 25 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_3_1": "<b><font color='#ff0000'>Removes Tombstone. </font></b> \n\n New Active Ability: <b><font color='#eabe10'>Hypnodancer</font></b> \n\n The hero gains speed and casts Decay around himself every 3 seconds. You cannot attack and also gain unlimited vision. \n\n Duration: <b><font color='#eabe10'>3</font></b> sec. \n Movement Speed: <b><font color='#eabe10'>20%</font></b> Radius: 600 \n Cooldown: 25 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_4_0": "Hypnodancer Cooldown Reduction: 5/10/15 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_4_1": "Hypnodancer Cooldown Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b>/10/15 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_4_2": "Hypnodancer Cooldown Reduction: 5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/15 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_4_3": "Hypnodancer Cooldown Reduction: 5/10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>15</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_undying_5_0": "Hypnodancer Mana Cost and Loss Reduction: 50%/100% \n\n Decay Duration Increase: 10/20 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_5_1": "Hypnodancer Mana Cost and Loss Reduction: <b><font color='#eabe10'>50%</font></b>/100% \n\n Decay Duration Increase: <b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>/20 sec.",
    "modifier_undying_5_2": "Hypnodancer Mana Cost and Loss Reduction: 50%/<b><font color='#eabe10'>100%</font></b> \n\n Decay Duration Increase: 10/<b><font color='#eabe10'>20</font></b> sec.",
    "modifier_undying_6_0": "Armor: 5/10",
    "modifier_undying_6_1": "Armor: <b><font color='#eabe10'>5</font></b>/10",
    "modifier_undying_6_2": "Armor: 5/<b><font color='#eabe10'>10</font></b>",
    "modifier_undying_7_0": "Flesh Golem becomes a Passive Ability.",
    "modifier_undying_7_1": "Flesh Golem becomes a <b><font color='#eabe10'>Passive Ability</font></b>.",
    "modifier_undying_8_0": "Each Attack restores Health: 8/16",
    "modifier_undying_8_1": "Each Attack restores Health: <b><font color='#eabe10'>8</font></b>/16",
    "modifier_undying_8_2": "Each Attack restores Health: 8/<b><font color='#eabe10'>16</font></b>",
    "modifier_undying_9_0": "Decay also steals Agility: 2/4",
    "modifier_undying_9_1": "Decay also steals Agility: <b><font color='#eabe10'>2</font></b>/4",
    "modifier_undying_9_2": "Decay also steals Agility: 2/<b><font color='#eabe10'>4</font></b>",
    "modifier_undying_10_0": "<b><font color='#ff0000'> Removes Tombstone. Flesh Golem attacks no longer summon zombies. </font></b> \n\n New Passive Ability: Tombstone Body \n\n Summons invulnerable Zombies around the Hero. \n\n Max Zombies: 1/2/3 \n Zombie Damage: 34 \n Radius: 400",
